## Summary
The Government of the Azores emphasizes health as a strategic priority. They have announced the achievement of a milestone in their Recovery and Resilience Plan (PRR), marking progress in health-related goals.

## Key Points
- Health is designated as a strategic priority by the Azorean government.
- A significant milestone in the PRR (Recovery and Resilience Plan) has been fulfilled.
- This event indicates ongoing implementation of health initiatives under recovery frameworks.


